{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1012508001:0":{"text":"手紙はもう読みましたね……間違いなくイミルは傷を癒やすためにここに隠れていました。そしてその間の護衛として、ブラックゴールド商会の人がいたわけですね。","source_cn":"信件大家都看过了吧……这里的确是伊米尔的藏身处，他在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F07863F473A4594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012508002:1":{"text":"肝心な情報が抜けているわよ。その見返りにイミルはこの場所を差し出した……おそらく、ここはもう商会の実験畑になってしまっている……","source_cn":"别落下关键信息，伊米尔承诺的酬劳是这片土地，恐怕……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025401858FDD42C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012508003:1":{"text":"なんの権利があってこんなことを！","source_cn":"他无权这么做！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14607EBBB651FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012508004:1":{"text":"土地をブラックゴールド商会に渡すなど、皆の崇拝していた賢者は、何もかも偽りだったのか！？","source_cn":"出卖土地给黑金商会，万人敬仰的伊米尔大贤者到底还有多少谎言？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E357B4F11E731E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012508005:0":{"text":"護衛にこれほどの見返りが必要ということは、相当の深手を負っているのかも……","source_cn":"如此酬劳换来的守卫，看样子他伤得不轻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C20B28DEC3B79C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_